# Select on NEW GAME at the main menu, then Selects on whatever follows. This is the probe that
# established that Select reaches Name Entry and that each further Select types a letter — and
# that the tick does nothing until a name has been typed.
600: select
900: shot
1200: select
1500: shot
1800: select
2100: shot
2400: select
2700: shot
3000: shot
3600: shot
3600: quit
